# Simple Water Purifier
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.simplewaterpurifier.name=Simple Water Purifier
simplification.recipe.simple_water_purifier=Simple Water Purifier
simplification.simple_water.button.wireless=Power source: wireless network
simplification.simple_water.button.wireless.on=On - every run is paid for out of your wireless network
simplification.simple_water.button.wireless.off=Off - power comes from the energy hatches
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.1=The Simple Water Purifier throws the complicated purification line away and makes purified water in one very simple step
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.2=The price? A quantum-superposition power draw and "Schrodinger's cat" style reagent consumption
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.3=The t1 structure makes purified water of grades 1 and 2
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.4=The t2 structure makes grades 1 to 4
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.5=The t3 structure makes grades 1 to 6
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.6=The t4 structure makes grades 1 to 8 and stable baryonic matter
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.7=Mod: GT Simplification  Contributors: bmhwwr, QionSi
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.8=The energy hatch tier never limits the recipe voltage
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.9=Supports multi-amp energy hatches and laser hatches
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.10=Installing a Grid Upgrade Hatch lets it draw power from the wireless network
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.11=This machine does not overclock; every recipe is fixed at 120 seconds
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.12=The structure tier is chosen by the purifier chip in the controller slot: none for t1, then the T2/T3/T4 chips for their own tier only
simplification.tooltip.simpleWaterPurifier.13=Every hatch goes on a Reinforced Sterile Water Plant Casing
