gt.blockmachines.multimachine.arureflection.name=Reflection of Aru
simplification.tooltip.aruReflection.1=Deep in the Red King's tomb lies Aru, the virtual paradise he built with sky-island technology for the Golden Dreamland. It never opened; forbidden knowledge seeped in, the paradise became a tomb, and it stood silent for thousands of years.
simplification.tooltip.aruReflection.2=When the World Tree was corrupted and the old record system neared collapse, the Lord of Wisdom found Aru shared that technology, rewrote it, and set it in the Tree's place - wired to the ley lines and powered by the Eternal Oasis, so this unfinished paradise now carries the world's data and memory.
simplification.tooltip.aruReflection.3=The paradise threads of the Red King's age still run underneath; but the promise of the far shore has become the centre of this one.
simplification.tooltip.aruReflection.4=Burns EU directly to produce computation, 100 EU per unit
simplification.tooltip.aruReflection.5=Mod: GT Simplification  Contributors: Berylite, QionSi
simplification.tooltip.aruReflection.6=The energy hatch tier never limits the recipe voltage
simplification.tooltip.aruReflection.7=Supports multi-amp energy hatches and laser hatches
